     "type": "teaming_up",
     "status": "carried_out",
     "excerpt": "The S5 language distinguishes the 8-per-100,000 threshold as a trigger for regulator review and corrective action—not an automatic recall—while preserving the regulator's authority to order a recall when warranted.",
     "kind": "cross_section_trade",
     "sections": [
      "S2_thermal_testing",
